\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu -2: Traders Eyeing Refinancing Rates \b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 09:16\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  If the leu isn't driven down by dollar purchases, said another trader, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will likely reduce refinancing rates \par \par \uc2  "We expected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Wednesday) but it didn't come," said one trader with a foreign bank. "Instead of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Thursday) the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might lower refinancing rates." \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Romania (NBR) is to hold its weekly refinancing auction and possibly set new refinancing interest rates for banks in overdraught Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Results of the refinancing auction will be released just after \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets close at 2 p.m. local time, noon GMT. \par \par \uc2  The refinancing rate has been roughly stable for the last three weeks at 225% yearly for 15-days loans but traders predict it could drop Thursday. The NBR has used the refinancing rate to force banks to raise interest rates offered to clients on term deposits, thereby reducing the amount of lei on the market. \par \par \uc2  To avoid the refinancing rates, many banks are offering term interest rates as high as 150% yearly on one-month deposits and clients have deposited record amounts in the banks. \par \par \uc2  A reduction in the refinancing rate, say traders, could increase the amount of lei on the market and drive up the dollar in \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 , substituting the expected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par As reported, the NBR told traders tweek that it was planning on buying\par dollars as it felt the leu's value was too high.\par     --Adam Brown\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 27-03-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0816GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1802 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011006dt3r004y9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
