\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2 / \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  -3: Dollar Sale Drives Up Leu Wednesday \b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 09:53\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials weren't immediately available for comment. \par \par \uc2  Turnover on the hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in Romania averages between $15 million and $18 million per day and the trader said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would only need to buy a few million dollars to drive down the leu. \par \par \uc2  Three traders said the leu strengthened shortly after opening when a single institution, which they said was a foreign bank, sold more than one million dollars. \par \par \uc2  They said the institution sold the dollars to invest lei in Romania's over the counter (OTC), Rasdaq mar. \par \par \uc2  A trader predicted that, if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  soon, the leu will gain strength again over the next week or two. He said foreign portfolio investment is expected to increase and dollar purchasing for imports are falling. Oil imports, in particular, are dropping after the winter months. \par \par \uc2  But he said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again if the leu strengthens to 7,200 or more to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Traders say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice since the government ended in mid-February an 11-month ban on dollar dealing for all but four banks with close government ties. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Both times, the NBR sold between $5 million and $10 million to drive\par the leu up, said traders.\par     --Adam Brown\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 26-03-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0853GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1802 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011006dt3q004mq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
