\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  leu ends firmer on c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 424 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, March 7 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu closed Friday stronger at 6,800/7,200 to the dollar against 7,000/500 in early trading as a midday with help from a midday \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  "Inflows on the money market helped the dollar in early trading when it climbed to 7,500/8,000, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepped in immediately to mop up leu funds," said one trader. \par \par \uc2  "It was a clear attempt to support the leu," said another, estimating that the BNR sold some $7.0 million and bought around $2.0 million. \par \par \uc2  BNR officials confirmed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's actions on Friday but declined to confirm the size of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which it called "a test." \par \par \uc2  "I wouldn't call it an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it was rather a test," said BNR spokesman Adrian Vasilescu, without elaborating. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers speculated that the BNR was poised to lash out at banks that had not extended their rollover T-bills on offer on Friday. Results of Friday's subscription were not available. \par \par \uc2  Short-term money market rates fell to some 215/230 percent from near 300 percent in the early hours as the market digested Thursday's drop to 226.31 percent from 426.5 percent in the average auctioned credit rate. \par \par \uc2  On Friday, the BNR also postponed for the second week in a row announcing a new method of computing the reference exchange rate for the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  but gave no reason for the delay. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the delay might affect the banks, because minimum reserves on banks' hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  deposits, held in leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , are converted at that rate. \par \par \uc2  "This will trigger an artificial rise in reserve targets as the 7,744 level of the reference rate is by far weaker than the market rates," said one dealer with a state bank. \par \par \uc2  Last month, the BNR gave up computing the leu's reference rate after restoring local dealer licences to 24 banks, which are now market makers along with four others. \par \par \uc2  The reference rate is frozen at 7,744 lei to the dollar, computed on February 19. Vasilescu said that level would remain effective until a new method was announced. \par \par \uc2  Banks' quotes continued to reflect a wide range, with leu-dollar rates from 6,000/100 to 7,400/8,400. \par \par \uc2  Leu-dollar retail rates were flat near 6,200/700 to 6,800/7,150. \par \par \uc2  -- Mirela Eremia, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt3708ytj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
