\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  C.Bank seen  \highlight22\uc2 intervening \highlight\uc2  on  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market. \b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Feb 26 (Reuter) - Operators on \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market said on Wednesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which rose to 7,000/00 to the dollar from an opening of 8,200/00 to 8,900/00. \par \par \uc2  "The National (\b \highlight22\uc2 central) Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sold dollars today," one dealer with the private  Ion Tiriac Bank told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) declined to confirm \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market. \par \par \uc2  A BNR spokesman said the bank -- which has so far refrained from stepping in to support the sagging leu which has fallen from 4,100 since January 1 -- would make an announcement at a press conference on Friday. \par \par \uc2  "The BNR has sold dollars in a bid to soak up leu liquidities from the market," a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Traders said slackening demand for dollars had also been influenced by Tuesday's announcement that Romanian electricity authority Renel was raising $150 million from international markets, in a corporate bond issue led by Merrill Lynch. \par \par \uc2  A dealer said the BNR's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not been a massive one, but that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wanted to "send a signal to the market," following a recent drive to tighten its monetary policies. \par \par \uc2  Operators expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to further reduce the amount on offer at its auction for refinancing credits on Thursday, which they said would further whet "leu hunger." \par \par \uc2  Latest official data put the BNR's own reserves at $812.2 million in January. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt2q09jpu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
