c2  requirements of small importers preparing for the festive season. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dealers have been arguing for some time that the reference\par rate is overvalued by at least 10%, and have called for an official\par devaluation of 300-400 lei/dollar.\par    -Kevin Smith\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 15-11-96\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1246GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1802 1901 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011013dsbf00lvk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
