\par\par \b \uc2  Romania  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  said in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market again. \b0\par\par\uc2 210 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Dezember 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Dec 20 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local inter-bank market on Wednesday, dealers said, helping the leu firm to 2,700-2,750 to the dollar from around 2,790 in the morning. \par \par \uc2  "It was again in the market today. I couldn't say whether it bought or sold dollars but it was there," a private bank dealer told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  Earlier on Wednesday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed it had stepped into the inter-bank market on Tuesday, selling and buying dollars. It said it was ready to do so again if necessary. \par \par \uc2  "Hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sellers who stepped into the market today also helped push the leu to the present levels," another trader said, adding that the leu's upward trend should continue. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was supervising the market in a bid to offer more support to the leu and back its recent recovery after a 30 percent over the past three months. \par \par \uc2  "It seems the leu's rebound is not a temporary one and with more sellers in the market it could close the year at 2,700 to the dollar," a senior dealer said. -- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103drck00llu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
