\par\par \b \uc2  Romania leu ends day hovering around 2,800. \b0\par\par\uc2 343 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Dezember 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Dec 12 (Reuter) - The Romanian leu ended the day easier at around 2,825 to the dollar from 2,800 in a moribund interbank market where state-owned banks quoted far stronger rates. \par \par \uc2  Romania's big four state-owned banks displayed offers of a 2,549/30 spread on the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  -- more or less where the government and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  say they want the leu. \par \par \uc2  Private banks such as ING's Bucharest branch posted what dealers said were somewhat more realistic rates of 2,710/10. \par \par \uc2  City retail exchange houses were still exchanging the leu at around 3,000 to the dollar -- ignoring government and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  warnings to narrow the gap with the inter-bank market. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market was opaque at best with no-one trading at anything close to the rates advertised. Trading was more or less confined to client-related transactions. \par \par \uc2  One dealer at a state-owned bank acknowledged his institution was effectively underpinning the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "We do not wish to weaken the Romanian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. \par \par \uc2  "At the moment there are different opinions (between traders) about where the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be. I think that our state ownership gives us a particular view." \par \par \uc2  He said his bank felt it could serve its clients adequately around the 2,600 level for the leu. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the 2,600 level to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the government has said it is the level that it and the IMF wants. \par \par \uc2  Commercial bank dealers said the real market was closer to 2,800/50 but that virtually no inter-bank work was happening. \par \par \uc2  "Frankly, I am not willing to sell on the market right now," one private bank dealer said. "If I wanted to buy I don't think I could buy at the rates quoted on the screen." \par \par \uc2  Money market interest rates were unchanged at 54.64 percent for one week. -- Peter Bale, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103drcc00se1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
