\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  PM says  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  stable, no  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Peter Bale \par \uc2 520 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Dezember 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Dec 5 (Reuter) - Prime Minister Nicolae Vacaroiu said he believed Romania's leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had stabilised after a sharp fall and that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not needed. \par \par \uc2  "The exchange rate got stabilised and there is no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the National Bank," Vacaroiu told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  Despite complaints from \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders that dollar supplies have dried up and that pressure on the leu remains, Vacaroiu insisted the local inter-bank market was working. \par \par \uc2  The government had allowed a one-off 10 percent depreciation in consultation with the International Monetary Fund (IMF) taking the leu from around 2,400 two weeks ago to around 2,600. \par \par \uc2  While private exchange houses, whom he accused of serving the "subterranean" economy, have since pushed it further, Vacaroiu said he believed the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was more or less stable. \par \par \uc2  "In my opinion as an economist, this is an equilibrium exchange rate. It is a stable exchange rate now," he said. \par \par \uc2  A steady depreciation over the past 18 months of about 1.0 percent a month gathered pace with the leu falling a nominal 36 percent at exchange houses in a matter of weeks. \par \par \uc2  Over the past year the leu has halved nominally on the interbank market to 2,850 from 1,800. With inflation forecast at 25 percent this year that makes a 30 percent real depreciation. \par \par \uc2  While leu weakness and dollar hoarding are traditional ahead of the icy Romanian winter the fall has been much sharper than last year, eroding hard won confidence in the local unit. \par \par \uc2  Vacaroiu said the fall had been exacerbated this year by the illegal activity of exchange houses but more fundamentally by a tripling in the trade deficit to a forecast $1.5 billion, built in large measure, according to the premier, on capital imports. \par \par \uc2  "Imports exceeded exports and we had a trade balance deficit," he said in an interview. "Of course, in the case of an economy such as Romania's, which is coming out of the crisis and is being modernised -- if it wants to enter Europe it should modernise from an economic point of view -- it's normal." \par \par \uc2  Private economists, however, say they fear the current account deficit is structural and funded too short term. It has been a major factor in difficult negotiations with the International Monetary Fund on an extended stand-by agreement. \par \par \uc2  Far from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell dollars, Vacaroiu said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was more likely to buy dollars -- as it has already done in recent weeks -- to reinforce its hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. \par \par \uc2  "The National Bank, in cooperation with myself, has the task to consolidate its hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves and it buys on the market, so there is no question on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. \par \par \uc2  Vacaroiu said he was generally satisfied with the \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  of an inter-bank market created about 18 months ago but which private bankers say is manipulated by state banks on behalf of the powerful \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and government. "The entire \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on the screen is real," he said. -- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103drc5010sv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
