\par\par \b \uc2  Romania  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  says will smooth  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market. \b0\par\par\uc2 282 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 November 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST Nov 15 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , confirming it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday, said it was prepared to do so whenever necessary to "smooth out inter-bank market". \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at the National Bank of Romania, Adrian Grigoriu, told Reuters the bank was adopting an active policy to ensure the market operated smoothly. \par \par \uc2  "We will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  both by selling and buying to smooth out the inter-bank market," Grigoriu said. \par \par \uc2  He confirmed dealers reports that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had bought dollars on Tuesday saying the aim of its move was to reinforce \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. He declined to give details. \par \par \uc2  "We also wanted to test the market as on Monday there were no inter-bank deals," Grigoriu said. \par \par \uc2  He said the market responded quickly to the call for quotes on the dollar and behaved "professionally" offering both buy and sell quotations and abiding by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  rules on offering continuous prices during the trading day. \par \par \uc2  Dealers earlier said that the bank had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday using a tactic to underpin the leu by exposing some big players to greater risk and to show market that there was liquidity. \par \par \uc2  The leu was steady at around 2,500 to the dollar in the inter-bank market on Wednesday despite earlier predictions that it would fall to 2,700. The leu has fallen to 2,500 to the dollar from 2,200 over the past month, accelerating a steady depreciation over the past year of about 1.0 percent a month. \par \par \uc2  Tuesday's was the first acknowleged \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  for about three months. -- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103drbf01w2w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
