\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania central bank intervened \highlight\uc2  Tuesday - dealers. \b0\par\par\uc2 330 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 November 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Nov 15 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday using an unorthodox tactic to buy dollars at a rate firmer than that generally quoted on the market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars on Tuesday at a price higher than the exchange rates on the market," said one dealer. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the tactic effectively underpinned the local leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by exposing major banks which were long on the dollar to greater risk and show there were dollars available. \par \par \uc2  The leu has fallen sharply over the past month affected by low hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  offer on the inter-bank market and facing a traditional pre-winter period of dollar-hoarding. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials were not available for comment. But dealers said the National Bank of Romania had bought about $6.0 million late in trading on Tuesday. They said the bank called several dealers asking for a spot quote on the dollar/leu cross. \par \par \uc2  Apparently thinking that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wanted to sell dollars to support the leu, the dealers offered firmer exchange rates than they were generally offering to buy dollars. \par \par \uc2  Dealers declined to give the rates but the leu was steady at around 2,500 to the dollar in the inter-bank market today despite earlier predictions that it would fall to 2,700. \par \par \uc2  "I don't know exactly what is behind the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move but it seems it wanted to hit some major players by testing the market," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The same dealer said the tactic had successfully proven that there were dollars available on the market but the banks were contributing to the dollar hoarding by going long. \par \par \uc2  The leu has fallen to 2,500 to the dollar from 2,200 over the past month, accelerating a steady and planned depreciation over the past year of about 1.0 percent a month. -- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103drbf01vvn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
