\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania central bank intervenes \highlight\uc2  to prop up leu. \b0\par\par\uc2 296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Februar 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Feb 9 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's National Bank (BNR) sold dollars on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Wednesday to prop up the leu, an official said today. \par \par \uc2  "We sold dollars late on Wednesday to pump liquidity into the market to support the leu," BNR deputy manager Adrian Grigoriu told Reuters, declining to specify the amount sold. \par \par \uc2  Late on Wednesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced the leu's reference rate at 1,796 to dollar, down from a previous 1,797 level. The BNR's reference rate is computed as a weighted average based on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  operators' reports. \par \par \uc2  Dealers were not immediately available to comment on the BNR \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  but on Wednesday they said they expected the leu's reference rate to slip below 1,800 this week. \par \par \uc2  Commercial banks quoted the leu within a range of 1,794/99- 1,799/07 per dollar on Thursday, close to Wednesday's levels. \par \par \uc2  "We will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again to temper the market if necessary," Grigoriu said without elaborating. \par \par \uc2  Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed dealers' fears that the BNR would step into the market this week to keep the leu at what they called "a social exchange rate". \par \par \uc2  Dealers said a leu/dollar rate below 1,800 would send electricity costs up, triggering further price hikes. \par \par \uc2  "We do not agree with (leu's) depreciation as it will encourage non-competitive companies to use it to cover their deficiencies," Finance Minister Florin Georgescu recently said. \par \par \uc2  Georgescu said the BNR had enough hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  resources to keep the leu's exchange rate stable. \par \par \uc2  BNR's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves were $591.5 million last December, when Romania's total reserves topped $2.1 billion. -- Mirela Eremia, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011104dr29017x0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
