\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  dealers see lower leu without  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 211 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Januar 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Jan 3 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  may depreciate against the dollar this week unless the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Without \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  I see the leu down at around 1,800 to the dollar," a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday the leu opened around 1,775/85 to the dollar, down from its 1,770/85 level at Friday's close. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Mugur Isarescu told Reuters on Thursday that the bank preferred to see a gradual movement of the leu. \par \par \uc2  But he said the bank was ready to step into the market if necessary as it did in December, when it spent $20-30 million to support the Romanian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Traders said there was a shortage of dollars on the market. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar became attractive lately as gains from interest on lei deposits fell over the past months. People have to protect their lei and they do not have so far other alternatives which could offer higher earnings," a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers generally declined to commit themselves to any long-term forecasts as they were waiting commercial banks' reactions to a cut in \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  interest rates on Tuesday. -- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011104dr1301cv1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\pic