\par\par \b \uc2  Romania's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  cuts rates, leu may suffer. \b0\par\par\uc2 362 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Januar 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Jan 3 (Reuter) - Romania's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut its key interest rates on Tuesday, stirring fears that the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  may depreciate in reaction to the cuts unless the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) cut its reference rate to an annual 55 percent from 58 percent and its overdraft rate to 105 percent a year from 130 percent, a bank official said. \par \par \uc2  The reference rate is the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicative rate while its overdraft rate is the rate it charges when banks borrow from their account at BNR. \par \par \uc2  "The cuts were in line with decreasing inflation and expectations of low inflation in the next months," Cezar Botel deputy manager of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers were less sanguine. "Without \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  I see the leu down at around 1,800 to the dollar," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday the leu opened around 1,775/85 to the dollar, down from its 1,770/85 level on Friday's close. \par \par \uc2  BNR governor Mugur Isarescu last week said the bank was ready to step into the market if necessary as it did in December, when it spent $20-30 million to support the leu. \par \par \uc2  Traders said there was a shortage of dollars on the market and they believed it was not only a seasonal phenomenon. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar became attractive lately as gains from interest on lei deposits fell over the past few months. People have to protect their lei and so far they don't have other alternatives which could offer higher earnings," a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers generally declined to commit themselves to any long-term forecasts saying they were waiting for the reaction of the commercial banks to the interest rates cut. \par \par \uc2  Commercial banks' interest rates are currently at 65 percent a year and analysts said they expect banks to follow the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  move to reduce rates. \par \par \uc2  BNR's Isarescu said he expected inflation in the year to end-December 1994 to fall to 66 percent from 295.5 percent in 1993 compared with a 75 percent forecast under an IMF restructuring programme. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011104dr1301cut\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Romania near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjus